{
  "units": [
    {
      "stem": "torah_ribbono_malle_mishalot",
      "urn": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:ribbono_shel_olam/malle_mishalot",
      "title": {
        "he": "רבון העולם מלא משאלותינו",
        "en": "Master of the world, fulfil our wishes"
      },
      "languages": {
        "he": [
          {
            "paragraph": 1,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s162",
                "printed_page": "70",
                "text": "רִבּוֹן הָעוֹלָם מַלֵּא מִשְׁאֲלוֹתֵינוּ לְטוֹבָה וְהָפֵק רְצוֹנֵנוּ וְתֶן־לָנוּ שְׁאֵלָתֵנוּ וּמְחַל עַל כָּל־עֲוֹנוֹתֵינוּ וְעַל־כָּל־עֲוֹנוֹת אַנְשֵׁי בָתֵּֽינוּ מְחִילָה בְחֶֽסֶד מְחִילָה בְּרַחֲמִים וְטַהֲרֵנוּ מֵחֲטָאֵינוּ וּמֵעֲוֹנוֹתֵינוּ וּמִפְּשָׁעֵינוּ. וְזָכְרֵנוּ בְּזִכְרוֹן טוֹב לְפָנֶיךָ וּפָקְדֵנוּ בִּפְקֻדַּת יְשׁוּעָה וְרַחֲמִים וְזָכְרֵנוּ לְחַיִּים אֲרוּכִים יְטוֹבִים וּלְשָׁלוֹם וּפַרְנָסָה וְכַלְכָּלָה וְתֶן־לָנוּ לֶחֶם לֶאֱכוֹל וּבֶגֶד לִלְבּוֹשׁ וְעֹשֶׁר וְכָבוֹד וְאֹרֶךְ יָמִים לַהֲגוֹת בְּתוֹרָתֶךָ וּלְקַיֵּם מִצְווֹתֶֽיהָ וְשֵׂכֶל וּבִינָה לְהָבִין וּלְהַשְׂכִּיל עִמְקֵי סוֹדוֹתֶיהָ וּשְׁלַח רְפוּאָה לְכָל־מַכְאוֹבֵינוּ וּתְבָרֵךְ אֶת־כָּל־מַעֲשֵׂה יָדֵינוּ וְתִגְזוֹר עָלֵינוּ גְּזֵרוֹת טוֹבוֹת יְשׁוּעוֹת וְנֶחָמוֹת וּתְבַטֵּל מֵעָלֵינוּ כָּל־גְּזֵרוֹת קָשׁוֹת. וְתַטֶּה לֵב הַמַּלְכוּת וְיוֹעֲצֶיהָ וְשָׂרֶיהָ עָלֵינוּ לְטוֹבָה. אָמֵן וְכֵן יְהִי רָצוֹן:"
              }
            ],
            "end_reference": true,
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:ribbono_shel_olam/malle_mishalot/opening"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 2,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s162",
                "printed_page": "70",
                "text": "יִהְיוּ לְרָצוֹן אִמְרֵי־פִי וְהֶגְיוֹן לִבִּי לְפָנֶיךָ יְיָ צוּרִי וְגֹאֲלִי:"
              }
            ],
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:ribbono_shel_olam/malle_mishalot/yehi",
            "source": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/19/15",
            "source_reference": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/19/15",
            "chapter_corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:ribbono_shel_olam/malle_mishalot/quotations/yihyu",
            "source_reference_corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:ribbono_shel_olam/malle_mishalot/quotations/yihyu/15",
            "end_reference": true
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 3,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s162",
                "printed_page": "70",
                "text": "וַאֲנִי תְפִלָּתִי־לְךָ יְיָ עֵת רָצוֹן אֱלֹהִים בְּרָב־חַסְדֶּךָ עֲנֵנִי בֶּאֱמֶת יִשְׁעֶךָ:"
              }
            ],
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:ribbono_shel_olam/malle_mishalot/vaani",
            "source": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/69/14",
            "source_reference": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/69/14",
            "chapter_corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:ribbono_shel_olam/malle_mishalot/quotations/vaani",
            "source_reference_corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:ribbono_shel_olam/malle_mishalot/quotations/vaani/14",
            "end_reference": true,
            "repeat_cue": {
              "text": "ג״פ.",
              "target": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:ribbono_shel_olam/malle_mishalot/vaani"
            }
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "paragraph": 1,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s163",
                "printed_page": "70",
                "text": "Master of the world, fulfil our wishes for the good, grant our will and give us our wish; forgive all our sins and all the sins of our household through forgiveness in grace and forgiveness in mercy and purify us from our transgressions, sins and iniquities; remember us benevolently before Thee and consider us with salvation and compassion; remember us for a long and good life, for peace, livelihood and sustenance; give us bread to eat, clothes to wear, wealth and honour, long life to ponder on Thy Torah and fulfil its commandments and sense and intelligence, to grasp and understand the depths of its mysteries. Send healing for all our sufferings, bless all the work of our hands, decree for us good decrees, help and comfort; annul all harsh decrees from upon us, incline the heart of the kingdom, its advisers and princes for our good, Amen. Thus may it be Thy will."
              }
            ],
            "end_reference": true,
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:ribbono_shel_olam/malle_mishalot/opening"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 2,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s163",
                "printed_page": "70",
                "text": "May the words of my mouth and the meditation of my heart find favour before Thee, Lord, my rock and my redeemer."
              }
            ],
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:ribbono_shel_olam/malle_mishalot/yehi",
            "source": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/19/15",
            "source_reference": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/19/15",
            "chapter_corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:ribbono_shel_olam/malle_mishalot/quotations/yihyu",
            "source_reference_corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:ribbono_shel_olam/malle_mishalot/quotations/yihyu/15",
            "end_reference": true
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 3,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s163",
                "printed_page": "70",
                "text": "My prayer goes out to Thee, O Lord, at a time of favour, O God, in Thine abundant mercy, answer me with the truth of Thy salvation."
              }
            ],
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:ribbono_shel_olam/malle_mishalot/vaani",
            "source": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/69/14",
            "source_reference": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/69/14",
            "chapter_corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:ribbono_shel_olam/malle_mishalot/quotations/vaani",
            "source_reference_corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:ribbono_shel_olam/malle_mishalot/quotations/vaani/14",
            "end_reference": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "stem": "torah_berikh_shemeh",
      "urn": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:berikh_shemeh",
      "title": {
        "he": "בְּרִיךְ שְׁמֵהּ",
        "en": "Berikh Shemeh"
      },
      "languages": {
        "he": [
          {
            "paragraph": 1,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s164",
                "printed_page": "71",
                "text": "בְּרִיךְ שְׁמֵהּ דְּמָרֵא עָלְמָא בְּרִיךְ כִּתְרָךְ וְאַתְרָךְ. יְהֵא רְעוּתָךְ עִם עַמָּךְ יִשְׂרָאֵל לְעָלַם. וּפוּרְקַן יְמִינָךְ אַחֲזֵי לְעַמָּךְ בְּבֵית מַקְדְּשָׁךְ וּלְאַמְטוּיֵא לָנָא מִטּוּב נְהוֹרָךְ וּלְקַבֵּל צְלוֹתָנָא בְּרַחֲמִין. יְהֵא רַעֲוָא קֳדָמָךְ דְּתוֹרִיךְ לָן חַיִּין בְּטִיבוּתָא."
              }
            ],
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:berikh_shemeh/berikh"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 1,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s164",
                "printed_page": "71",
                "text": " וְלֶהֱוֵא אֲנָא פְקִידָא בְּגוֹ צַדִּיקַיָּא לְמִרְחַם עֲלַי וּלְמִנְטַר יָתִי וְיָת כָּל־דִּי לִי וְדִי לְעַמָּךְ יִשְׂרָאֵל. אַנְתְּ הוּא זָן לְכֹלָּא וּמְפַרְנֵס לְכֹלָּא. אַנְתְּ הוּא שַׁלִּיט עַל־כֹּלָּא. אַנְתְּ הוּא דְשַׁלִּיט עַל־מַלְכַיָּא וּמַלְכוּתָא דִּילָךְ הִיא. אֲנָא עַבְדָּא דְקֻדְשָׁא בְּרִיךְ הוּא דְּסָגִדְנָא קַמֵּהּ וּמִקַּמָּא דִּיקַר אוֹרַיְתֵהּ בְּכָל־עִדָּן וְעִדָּן. לָא עַל אֱנָשׁ רָחִצְנָא. וְלָא עַל־בַּר־אֱלָהִין סָמִכְנָא. אֶלָּא בֶּאֱלָהָא דִשְׁמַיָּא. דְּהוּא אֱלָהָא קְשֹׁט. וְאוֹרַיְתֵהּ קְשֹׁט. וּנְבִיאוֹהִי קְשֹׁט. וּמַסְגֵּא לְמֶעְבַּד טַבְוָן וּקְשֹׁט. בֵּהּ אֲנָא רָחִיץ. וְלִשְׁמֵהּ קַדִּישָׁא יַקִּירָא אֲנָא אֵמַר תּוּשְׁבְּחָן. יְהֵא רַעֲוָא קֳדָמָךְ דְּתִפְתַּח לִבִּי בְּאוֹרַיְתָא וְתַשְׁלִים מִשְׁאֲלִין דְּלִבִּי. וְלִבָּא דְכָל־עַמָּךְ יִשְׂרָאֵל. לְטַב וּלְחַיִּין וְלִשְׁלָם:"
              }
            ],
            "end_reference": true,
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:berikh_shemeh/velehevei"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "paragraph": 1,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s165",
                "printed_page": "71",
                "text": "Blessed be the Name of the Master of the world, blessed by Thy crown and Thy place. May Thy favour rest upon Thy people Israel in eternity. Show the salvation of Thy right hand to Thy people in Thy Sanctuary; grant us the goodness of Thy light and accept our prayer with compassion; may it be Thy will to grant us a long and happy life"
              }
            ],
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:berikh_shemeh/berikh"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 1,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s165",
                "printed_page": "71",
                "text": " and may I be remembered among the righteous so that Thou wilt have compassion on me and guard me and all that belongs to me and to Thy people Israel. Thou dost nourish all and sustain all; it is Thou who dost rule over all, Thou rulest over kings and the kingdom is Thine. I serve the Holy One, blessed be He, bow down before Him and His holy Torah at all times. I do not trust in men, I do not rely on angels, only on the God of heaven. He is the true God and His Torah is truth and His prophets are truth and He does goodness and truth in abundance. On Him do I rely and to His holy, honoured Name do I utter praise. Let it be Thy will to open my heart to the Torah, to grant the requests of my heart and those of the whole people of Israel for the good, for life and for peace."
              }
            ],
            "end_reference": true,
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:berikh_shemeh/velehevei"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
